  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h3> About our brand and products:</h3><p>Hands of Love is a beauty and fashion brand offering high-quality wigs, hair, and statement pieces designed to boost confidence and self-expression. From everyday styles to luxury looks, our collection is curated to help women feel bold, beautiful, and effortlessly put together.</p><hr><h3>• What makes us different:</h3><p>We focus on <strong>affordable luxury</strong>—providing premium-looking wigs and styles without the high salon price. Our products are beginner-friendly, stylish, and versatile, making beauty accessible for everyone. We also prioritize trendy, in-demand looks that actually sell.</p><hr><h3>• How affiliates can earn:</h3><p>Earn <strong>20% commission</strong> on every sale you generate. The more you promote, the more you earn—no limits.</p><hr><h3>• How to promote us:</h3><p>Affiliates can promote through:</p><ul><li>TikTok videos (wig installs, transformations, reviews)</li><li>Instagram posts, reels, and stories</li><li>Product reviews and tutorials</li><li>Direct links to our store</li></ul><p>We recommend showing real results, styling tips, and before/after looks to increase conversions.</p><hr><h3>• Other information:</h3><ul><li>Fast and secure checkout for customers</li><li>Trend-driven products that are easy to promote</li><li>Perfect for beauty influencers, content creators, and beginners</li><li>Support is available if you need help promoting</li></ul></div>",
